{"version":1,"content":"<p>澳洲航空（Qantas）的一架空客A350-1000ULR超遠程客機，正式創造了商業航空史上最長的不間斷飛行距離紀錄。從澳大利亞墨爾本起飛後，飛機連續飛行24小時24分鐘，最終抵達法國圖盧茲，航程達到23155公裏。這一紀錄已經獲得國際航空聯合會（FAI）核實，並被健力士世界紀錄收錄。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585692.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.164819+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T05:39:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:33:58.536548+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"78c7c9186961e4accf5114e63885a879ae98d0c2783195c11600a7e7b4c5a5cd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}